# tools git SHA that the vendored copies were taken from.
# TOOLS_* preserves the upstream import hashes; VENDOR_* is the current in-repo drift contract.
# After editing a vendored file: python3 ci/bootstrap/update_vendor_hashes.py
# Verify from the repo root: node --test build/test/srcbuild-kkk2.test.mjs
# bootstrap.sh uses its sibling SDK builder, excludes nested state, builds target std before the
# compiler link, and links the stage1 host cjc against HRT rather than the colour runtime.
# stage1_host_identities.txt binds the host SDK runtime and the independent GHA host LLVM artifact.
# bootstrap.sh and stage1_host_runner.sh derive the Linux host tuple (x86_64 or
# aarch64) from uname instead of spelling linux_x86_64_cjnative (cjcj#73).
